#. Tag: author
#: windows-how-to.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Philip.Rodrigues;"
msgstr "&Philip.Rodrigues;"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Windows, How To Work Them"
msgstr "បង្អួច របៀប​ធ្វើ​ពួក​វា"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Window Management"
msgstr "ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​បង្អួច​មូលដ្ឋាន"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window Management"
msgstr "ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​បង្អួច"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each application running in &kde; has its own window, and some applications may "
"use more than one window. You can manipulate these windows in many ways to make "
"your desktop work for you. Here is a normal window:"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​នីមួយៗ​ដែល​រត់​ក្នុង KDE មាន​បង្អួច​ផ្ទាល់​ខ្លួន​របស់​វា "
"និង​កម្មវិធី​ខ្លះ​អាច​ប្រើ​បង្អួច​ច្រើន​ជាង​មួយ ។ អ្នក​អាច​រៀបចំ​បង្អួច​ទាំង"
"នេះ​ក្នុង​វិធី​ច្រើន​ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ផ្ទៃតុ​របស់​អ្នក​ធ្វើការ​សម្រាប់​អ្នក ។"
" នេះ​គឺ​ជា​បង្អួច​ធម្មតា ៖"

#. Tag: phrase
#: windows-how-to.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "A normal window"
msgstr "បង្អួច​ធម្មតា"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switching Between Windows"
msgstr "ប្ដូរ​រវាង​បង្អួច"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Focus (windows)"
msgstr "ផ្ដោត (បង្អួច)"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to use a window, it must be active. A window automatically becomes "
"active when you open it, so that the application you opened is immediately "
"ready to use. Only one window can be active at a time. The active window is the "
"one into which you can type, and can be distinguished from the others because "
"it has a different colored titlebar. (With the &kde; default theme, the active "
"window has a <replaceable>light blue</replaceable> titlebar, and the inactive "
"windows have <replaceable>gray</replaceable> titlebars.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Raising Windows"
msgstr "លើក​បង្អួច"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you want to work in a different window, you need to make it active. There "
"are two ways to do this:"
msgstr "ពេល​អ្នក​ចង់​ធ្វើការ​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​ផ្សេង​គ្នា អ្នក​ត្រូវការ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វា​សកម្ម"
" ។ មាន​វិធី​ពី​ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​នេះ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&LMB;-click on the window that you want to make active. The window will become "
"active and will be raised above other windows if it overlaps them."
msgstr "ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ​លើ​បង្អួច​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​សកម្ម ។ "
"បង្អួច​នឹង​ក្លាយ​ជា​សកម្ម ហើយ​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​លើក​ខាង​លើ​បង្អួច​ផ្សេង​ទៀត "
"បើ​វា​ជាន់​លើ​ពួក​វា ។"

#. Tag: keycombo
#: windows-how-to.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Alt;&Tab;"
msgstr "ប្ដូរ(Alt)ថេប"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold down &Alt; and press &Tab; (do not release the &Alt; key). A popup dialog "
"appears with a list of available windows, one of which is highlighted. You can "
"select a different window by pressing &Tab; again to move through the list, all "
"the time holding down &Alt;. When you release the &Alt; key, the window which "
"was highlighted is made active."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Moving Windows</title>"
msgstr "<title>ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Moving Windows</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first way to organize the windows on your desktop is to move them around. "
"You can move windows so that they overlap other windows, or so that you can see "
"the whole window. There are three ways to move a window:"
msgstr "វិធី​ទីមួយ​ដើម្បី​រៀបចំ​បង្អួច​លើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​របស់​អ្នក "
"គឺ​ត្រូវ​ផ្លាស់ទី​ពួក​វា​ជុំវិញ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច "
"ដូច្នេះ​ពួក​វា​ជាន់​បង្អួច​ផ្សេង​ទៀត ឬ​ដូច្នេះ​អ្នក​អាច​ឃើញ​បង្អួច​ទាំងមូល ។"
" មាន​វិធី​បី​ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the &LMB; on the window titlebar and hold it down. Move the mouse cursor "
"and the window moves with it. Release the mouse button, and the window remains "
"where you left it."
msgstr "ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ​លើ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង​បង្អួច និង​សង្កត់​វា​ចុះ ។ "
"ផ្លាស់ទី​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​កណ្ដុរ និង​បង្អួច​ផ្លាស់ទី​ជាមួយ​វា ។ "
"លែង​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ និង​បង្អួច​នៅ​កន្លែង​ដែល​អ្នក​ទុក​វា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the window menu using the leftmost button on the window titlebar (as "
"displayed below), and select <guimenuitem>Move</guimenuitem>"
". The mouse cursor moves to the center of the current window and by moving the "
"mouse around, you can move the window. Once you have moved the window to the "
"position you want, click the &LMB; to release it."
msgstr "បើ​ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​នៅ​លើ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង​បង្អួច "
"(ដូច​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ខាងក្រោម) និង​ជ្រើស <guimenuitem>ផ្លាស់ទី</guimenuitem> ។ "
"ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច​ផ្លាស់ទី​ទៅ​កណ្ដាល​នៃ​បង្អួច​បច្ចុប្បន្ន "
"និង​ដោយ​ផ្លាស់ទី​កណ្ដុរ​ជុំវិញ អ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច ។ "
"ពេល​អ្នក​បាន​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច​ទៅ​ទីតាំង​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​បាន "
"ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​ដើម្បី​លែង​វា ។"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window Menu"
msgstr "ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: windows-how-to.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Window Menu</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: windows-how-to.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Window Menu</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold down &Alt; and the &LMB; when the mouse cursor is above the window you "
"want to move. The mouse cursor changes to a compass, and by moving the mouse, "
"you can move the window. Just release the mouse button to release the window. "
"This method is particularly useful if the window titlebar has been moved off "
"the screen, so you cannot use the other methods."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Resizing Windows</title>"
msgstr "<title>ប្ដូរ​ទំហំ​បង្អួច</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Resizing Windows</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ប្ដូរ​ទំហំ​បង្អួច</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can make windows bigger or smaller, wider, or taller in one of two ways. "
"Just use whichever you are most comfortable with:"
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​បង្អួច​ធំ​ជាង ឬ​តូច​ជាង ទូលាយ​ជាង "
"ឬ​ខ្ពស់​ជាង​​ក្នុង​វិធី​មួយ​ក្នុង​ចំណោម​ពីរ ។ "
"គ្រាន់​តែ​ប្រើ​មួយ​ណា​ដែល​អ្នក​គិត​ថា​ស្រួល ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move the mouse cursor over the border of the window (it is light blue in the "
"screenshot above). The pointer will turn into a double-headed arrow. Click and "
"drag, and the edge of the window follows the mouse cursor, making the window "
"bigger or smaller. If you click on the borders on the top or bottom of the "
"window, you can adjust the height on its own. If you click on the borders on "
"the left or right of the window, you can adjust the width. To change both at "
"the same time, move the mouse cursor over the corner of the window. When the "
"pointer becomes a diagonal double-headed arrow, click and drag."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the leftmost button on the window titlebar to display the window menu. "
"Choose the <guimenuitem>Resize</guimenuitem> entry, and the mouse pointer will "
"become a double-headed arrow. Move the mouse cursor around to resize, and click "
"the &LMB; when you are done to release the window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot see the window border or the button for the window menu, you can "
"use &Alt; and the &RMB;: Hold down &Alt; and drag with the &RMB;. The window "
"will resize. You just release the &RMB; when you are done."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you just want to make a window as big as possible, so it takes up the whole "
"screen, use the <guibutton>Maximize<indexterm><primary>"
"Maximizing Windows</primary></indexterm></guibutton> "
"button, which is the second button from the right on the window titlebar. "
"Clicking with the &LMB; on this button will make the window as big as possible "
"in both directions; while clicking with the &MMB;<indexterm><primary>"
"Maximizing Windows</primary><secondary>Vertically</secondary></indexterm> "
"or the &RMB;<indexterm><primary>Maximizing Windows</primary><secondary>"
"Horizontally</secondary></indexterm> will increase the window's size in only "
"the vertical or horizontal direction, respectively."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Hiding Windows</title>"
msgstr "<title>លាក់​បង្អួច</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Hiding Windows</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>លាក់​បង្អួច</primary>"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimize"
msgstr "បង្រួម​អប្បបរមា"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you need to keep a program open, but you do not want it to take up space "
"on your desktop, you can minimize it or shade it. To minimize a window, click "
"the <guibutton>Minimize</guibutton> button, which is third from the right on "
"the window titlebar. The window will not be displayed, but the program is still "
"running, and an entry for it appears in the taskbar on the panel. To display "
"the window again, click on its entry in the taskbar. You can also use <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Alt;&Tab;</keycombo><indexterm><primary>"
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;&Tab;</keycombo></primary></indexterm>"
": see <xref linkend=\"switching-between-windows\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shade"
msgstr "ស្រមោល"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shading windows is very similar to minimizing them, but this time, only the "
"titlebar of the window is shown. To shade a window, double-click on the "
"titlebar. To restore the window, just double-click on the titlebar again."
msgstr "ស្រមោល​បង្អួច​គឺ​ស្រដៀន​ទៅ​និង​បង្រួម​អប្បបរមា​ពួក​វា ប៉ុន្តែ​នៅ​ពេល​នេះ "
"មាន​តែ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង​នៃ​បង្អួច​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ ។ ដើម្បី​ដាក់​ស្រមោល​បង្អួច "
"ចុច​ទ្វេរ​លើ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង ។ ដើម្បី​ស្ដារ​បង្អួច "
"គ្រាន់​តែ​ចុច​ទ្វេរ​លើ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង​ម្ដង​ទៀត ។"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cascading Windows"
msgstr "ល្បាក់​បង្អួច"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes you might have a whole lot of windows open and all over the place. By "
"selecting to cascade windows &kde; will automatically line them up as a "
"succession from the top-left of your screen. To use this option use your &MMB; "
"on the desktop, and then select <guimenuitem>Cascade Windows</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "Uncluttering Windows"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By selecting to unclutter your opened windows &kde; will attempt to use the "
"maximum available space of the desktop in order to display as much of each "
"window as possible. For example, should you have four windows open and you "
"request that they be uncluttered, they will each be placed in a corner of the "
"desktop, regardless of where they were originally. To use this option once "
"again use your &MMB; on the desktop and then select <guimenuitem>"
"Unclutter Windows</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Closing Windows</title>"
msgstr "<title>បិទ​បង្អួច</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Closing Windows</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>បិទ​បង្អួច</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you finish using an application, you will want to stop the application and "
"close its window. Once again, you have the choice of a few options:"
msgstr "ពេល​អ្នក​បញ្ចប់​ការ​ប្រើ​កម្មវិធី អ្នក​នឹង​ចង់​បញ្ឈប់​កម្មវិធី "
"និង​បិទ​បង្អួច​របស់​វា ។ ម្ដង​ទៀត អ្នក​មាន​ជម្រើស​មួយ​ចំនួន ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the rightmost button on the window titlebar. If you are editing a "
"document with that application, you will be asked whether you want to "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> your changes, <guibutton>Discard</guibutton> "
"them, or <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> your command to close the application."
msgstr "ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​នៅ​លើ​របារ​ចំណង​ជើង​បង្អួច ។ "
"បើ​អ្នក​កំពុង​កែ​សម្រួល​ឯកសារ​ជាមួយ​កម្មវិធី​នោះ "
"អ្នក​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​សួរ​ថា​តើ​អ្នក​ចង់ <guibutton>រក្សា​ទុក</guibutton> "
"ការ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ <guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ពួក​វា ឬ "
"<guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​របស់​អ្នក​ដើម្បី​បិទ​កម្មវិធី ។"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> option on the menubar. You will be presented with the same choice "
"of <guibutton>Save</guibutton>, <guibutton>Discard</guibutton>, or <guibutton>"
"Cancel</guibutton>."
msgstr "ប្រើ <menuchoice><guimenu>ឯកសារ</guimenu><guimenuitem>បិទ</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> ជម្រើស​នៅ​លើ​របារ​ម៉ឺនុយ ។ "
"អ្នក​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ជាមួយ​ជម្រើស​ដូចគ្នា​ "
"<guibutton>រក្សា​ទុក</guibutton> <guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ឬ "
"<guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton>-click on the respective window in &kicker;, "
"the &kde; panel, and then select <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
". You will be prompted with an option to save any documents that were being "
"edited."
msgstr "ចុច <mousebutton>ស្ដាំ</mousebutton> លើ​បង្អួច​រៀងៗ​ខ្លួន​ក្នុង​បន្ទះ KDE "
"Kicker និង​បន្ទាប់​ជ្រើស <guimenuitem>បិទ</guimenuitem> ។ "
"អ្នក​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ព្រមាន​ជាមួយ​ជម្រើស​ដើម្បី​បិទ​ឯកសារ​មួយ​ចំនួន អ្នក​នឹង​ត"
"្រូវ​បាន​ជូន​ដំណឹង​ជាមួយ​ជម្រើស​ដើម្បី​រក្សា​ឯកសារ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ដែល​កំពុង​ត្រូវ"
"​បាន​កែ​សម្រួល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F4</keycap></keycombo><indexterm>"
"<primary><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F4</keycap> </keycombo>"
"</primary></indexterm> . Once again, the confirmation dialog will be shown if "
"you were editing any documents."
msgstr "ចុច <keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Alt)<keycap>F4</keycap></keycombo><indext"
"erm><primary><keycombo action=\"simul\">ប្ដូរ(Alt)<keycap>F4</keycap> "
"</keycombo></primary></indexterm> ។ ម្ដង​ទៀត "
"ប្រអប់​ជូន​ដំណឹង​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ "
"បើ​អ្នក​កំពុង​កែ​សម្រួល​ឯកសារ​មួយ​ចំនួន ។"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Window Management"
msgstr "ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​បង្អួច​កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "kstart"
msgstr "Kstart"

#. Tag: author
#: windows-how-to.docbook:285 windows-how-to.docbook:340
#: windows-how-to.docbook:380 windows-how-to.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Richard.J.Moore; &Richard.J.Moore.mail;"
msgstr "&Richard.J.Moore; &Richard.J.Moore.mail;"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kstart;"
msgstr "Kstart"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The simplest way to access the advanced window management facilities in &kde; "
"is to use a little known utility called &kstart;, which is included in &kde; "
"since version 2.1 &kstart; lets you control the way an application interacts "
"with the window manager. The command is usually used to define special behavior "
"for commonly-used applications, but it can also be useful for integrating "
"non-&kde; applications into your desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using &kstart; is easy: you simply put <userinput><command>kstart</command>"
"</userinput> and some options before a command. To begin, let's look at how we "
"might use &kstart; to customize the behaviour of a &kcalc; window. The command "
"we'll use is as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command> <option>--ontop</option> "
"<option>--alldesktops</option> <option>kcalc</option></userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command> "
"<option>--ontop</option> <option>--alldesktops</option> "
"<option>kcalc</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With luck, the effect this command has should be fairly obvious - the kcalc "
"window will stay on top of all the others and be visible on every virtual "
"desktop. A feature that is less obvious is that this command will work with any "
"NET compliant environment, not just &kde;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We can pass arguments to programs we invoke with &kstart; as normal, for "
"example:"
msgstr "យើង​អាច​បញ្ជូន​បន្ត​ទៅ​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​យើង​ហៅ​ជាមួយ Kstart ជា​ធម្មតា ឧទាហរណ៍ ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command>\n"
"<option>--skiptaskbar</option> <option>--desktop</option>\n"
"1 xmessage'Hello World'</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command>\n"
"<option>--skiptaskbar</option> <option>--desktop</option>\n"
"1 xmessage'Hello World'</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command displays <computeroutput>Hello World</computeroutput> "
"with <application>xmessage</application> and ensures that the window will be "
"shown on the first virtual desktop and will be omitted from the taskbar. The "
"fact that this program is written using the Xt toolkit rather than being a "
"native &kde; application does not cause any problem for &kstart;, hopefully "
"this illustrates how &kstart; can be used to integrate foreign applications "
"into your &kde; desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other Special Window Settings"
msgstr "ការ​កំណត់​បង្អួច​ពិសេស​ផ្សេង​ទៀត"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While you can use &kstart; to assign particular window settings, &kde; also "
"allows you to alter these -- as well as other similar settings -- from the "
"program window itself. Simply select the leftmost button in the window titlebar "
"(or just hit <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F3</keycap></keycombo> "
"once the window is focued), and then go to <menuchoice><guisubmenu>"
"Advanced</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Special Window Settings...</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice>. As you can see, from here you change various things from its "
"geometry upon startup, to whether it should have a border or not."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "The System Tray"
msgstr "ថាស​ប្រព័ន្ធ"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that we know how to customize the decoration of a window let's take a look "
"at another aspect of the desktop: the system tray. The system tray is an area "
"in which an application can display a small window. It is used to display "
"status information or provide quick access to commands. A window that has an "
"item in the system tray usually disappears from the task manager when minimised "
"with the tray icon providing a replacement. Normally tray icons are "
"specifically developed as part of an application, but as with window "
"decorations, &kde; provides a tool for changing this: <application>"
"ksystraycmd</application>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To begin with, we'll take the standard application &kcalc; and turn it into a "
"system tray application. This is acheived with one simple command:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command> <option>"
"--title</option> 'kcalc' kcalc</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command> "
"<option>--title</option> 'kcalc' kcalc</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The icon shown in the tray is the one specified in the window hints and will be "
"updated if the icon changes. The window title is shown as a tooltip if you hold "
"the mouse over the icon. <application>ksystraycmd</application> "
"follows standard &kde; behaviour so the target window can be shown and hidden "
"by clicking the tray icon, and a standard context menu is available."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "More Complex Uses of <application>ksystraycmd</application>"
msgstr "ការ​ប្រើប្រាស់​ស្មុគស្មាញ​របស់ <application>ksystraycmd</application>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To illustrate the other features of <application>ksystraycmd</application>"
", we'll use a more complicated example: a &konsole; window tracking the "
"<filename>.xsession-errors</filename> file (this is the log file that records "
"what's happening on your desktop). To begin with, we'll simply look at how we "
"can view this:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>konsole</command> <option>--icon</option>"
"\n"
"log <option>--caption</option> 'X Log' \\ \n"
"<option>--nomenubar</option> <option>--notabbar</option>\n"
"<option>--noframe</option> \\ \n"
"<option>-e</option> tail -f ~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>konsole</command> "
"<option>--icon</option>\n"
"log <option>--caption</option> 'X Log' \\ \n"
"<option>--nomenubar</option> <option>--notabbar</option>\n"
"<option>--noframe</option> \\ \n"
"<option>-e</option> tail -f ~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <option>--caption</option> and <option>--icon</option> "
"arguments are provided as standard by &kde; applications. You can get a full "
"list of these global options by running an application with the <option>"
"--help-kde</option> and <option>--help-qt</option> parameters. Here we give our "
"&konsole; window the title 'X Log' and the icon <quote>log</quote>"
". You can use these options with any &kde; application and as mentioned above, "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> takes account of these when creating the "
"tray icon. The <option>-e</option> argument is specific to &konsole; and tells "
"it to run the <command>less</command> command. Despite its complexity, we can "
"easily move this window into the tray with <application>"
"ksystraycmd</application>:"
msgstr "អាគុយម៉ង់ <option>--caption</option> និង <option>--icon</option> "
""
"ត្រូវ​បាន​ផ្ដល់​ជា​ស្តង់ដារ​ដោយ​កម្មវិធី KDE ។ អ្នក​អាច​ទទួល​បាន​បញ្ជី​ជម្រើ"
"ស​សកល​ទាំងមូល​ទាំងនេះ​ដោយ​រត់​កម្មវិធី​ជាមួយ​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ <option>--help-"
"kde</option> និង <option>--help-qt</option> ។ ទីនេះ "
"អ្នក​ឲ្យ​បង្អួច​កុងសូល​នូវ​ចំណង​ជើង 'X Log' និង​រូប​តំណាង <quote>log</quote>"
" ។ អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស​ទាំងនេះ​ជាមួយ​កម្មវិធី KDE ណា​មួយ "
"និង​ខាង​លើ​ដែល​បាន​បញ្ជាក់ <application>ksystraycmd</application> "
"ទទួល​ខុសត្រូវ​ទាំងនេះ​ពេល​បង្កើត​រូប​តំណាង​ថាស ។ អាគុយម៉ង់ "
"<option>-e</option> គឺ​ជាក់លាក់​ចំពោះ កុងសូល "
"និង​ប្រាប់​វា​ឲ្យ​រត់​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា <command>less</command> ។ "
"ថ្វី​បើ​ភាព​ស្មុគស្មាញ​របស់​វា "
"យើង​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច​នេះ​យ៉ាង​ស្រួល​ទៅ​ក្នុង​ថាស​ជាមួយ "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command>\n"
"<option>--hidden</option> <option>--title</option> 'X Log' \\\nkonsole --icon "
"log --caption 'XLog' \\ \n"
"--nomenubar --notabbar --noframe \\ \n"
"-e tail -f .xsession-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command>\n"
"<option>--hidden</option> <option>--title</option> 'X Log' \\\n"
"konsole --icon log --caption 'XLog' \\ \n"
"--nomenubar --notabbar --noframe \\ \n"
"-e tail -f .xsession-errors</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to being the most complex command we've used, this example "
"demonstrates the <option>--hidden</option> option which starts the command with "
"only the system tray icon visible. This example achieves our aim of providing "
"quick access to the log file, but we can do things a little more efficiently if "
"we only run the konsole process when it is visible. The command we use is"
msgstr "ក្នុង​ការ​បន្ថែម​ទៅ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​ដែល​ស្មុគស្មាញ​បំផុត​ដែល​ពួក​យើង​បាន​ប្រើ "
"ឧទាហរណ៍​នេះ​បង្ហាញ​ជម្រើស <option>--hidden</option> "
"ដែល​ចាប់ផ្ដើម​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​ជាមួយ​រូប​តំណាង​ថាស​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ដែល​មើល​ឃើញ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍"
"​នេះ​សម្រេច​គោល​បំណង​របស់​ពួក​យើង​នៃ​ការ​ផ្ដល់​ដំណើរ​ការ​រហ័ស​ទៅ​ឯកសារ​ចុះ​ក"
"ំណត់​ហេតុ ប៉ុន្តែ​យើង​អាច​ធ្វើ​អ្វី​មាន​ប្រសិទ្ធិ​ភាព​តិច "
"បើ​យើង​រត់​តែ​ដំណើរ​ការ​កុងសូល ពេល​វា​មើល​ឃើញ ។ "
"ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​ដែល​ពួក​យើង​ប្រើ​គឺ"

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command> <option>"
"--startonshow</option> \\\n --<option>icon</option> log <option>"
"--tooltip</option> 'X Log' \\ \n"
"konsole --icon log --caption 'X Log' \\\n--nomenubar --notabbar --noframe "
"\\\n-e tail -f ~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>ksystraycmd</command> "
"<option>--startonshow</option> \\\n"
" --<option>icon</option> log <option>--tooltip</option> 'X Log' \\ \n"
"konsole --icon log --caption 'X Log' \\\n"
"--nomenubar --notabbar --noframe \\\n"
"-e tail -f ~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The addition of the <option>--startonshow</option> parameter tells <application>"
"ksystraycmd</application> to start with only the tray icon visible (like the "
"<option>--hidden</option> parameter), and to wait until the user activates the "
"tray icon before running the target command. We've also used the <option>"
"--quitonhide</option> parameter which tells <application>"
"ksystraycmd</application> to terminate the target app whenever its window is "
"hidden. Using both these parameters ensures that our &konsole; tray icon "
"doesn't waste resources when we aren't using it. Creating and destroying the "
"target window as we do here prevents the standard icon and title handling of "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> from working, so we now need to specify "
"the initial icon and tooltip explicitly too."
msgstr "ការ​បន្ថែម​របស់​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ <option>--startonshow</option> ប្រាប់ "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> "
"ដើម្បី​ចាប់ផ្ដើម​តែ​ជាមួយ​រូប​តំណាង​ថាស​ដែល​មើល​ឃើញ (ដូចជា​ប៉ារ៉ាមែត្រ "
"<option>--hidden</option>) "
"និង​ដើម្បី​រង់ចាំ​ទាល់តែ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​រូប​តំណាង​ថាស​ប្រព័ន្ធ​សកម្ម "
"មុន​ពេល​រត់​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​គោលដៅ ។ យើង​បាន​ប្រើ​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ "
"<option>--quitonhide</option> ដែល​ប្រាប់ "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> ដើម្បី​បញ្ឈប់​កម្មវិធី​គោលដៅ "
"ពេល​បង្អួច​របស់​វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​លាក់ ។ ដោយ​ប្រើ​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ​ទាំងនេះ​ដើម្បី​ធាន"
"ា​ថា​រូប​តំណាង​ថាស​ប្រព័ន្ធ​កុងសូល​មិន​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ខាត​ធនធាន "
"ពេល​ពួក​យើង​មិន​កំពុង​ប្រើ​វា ។ ការ​បង្កើត និង​បំផ្លាញ​បង្អួច​គោលដៅ​ដូច​ពួក​"
"យើង​ធ្វើ​នៅ​ទីនេះ​ដើម្បី​ការពារ​រូប​តំណាង​ស្តង់ដារ "
"និង​ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​ចំណង​ជើង​របស់ <application>ksystraycmd</application> "
"ពី​ធ្វើការ ដូច្នេះ​ពួក​យើង​ឥឡូវ​ត្រូវការ​បញ្ជាក់​រូប​តំណាង​ចាប់ផ្ដើម "
"និង​ព័ត៌មាន​ជំនួយ​មិន​ផ្ទាល់​ផង​ដែរ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "Improving Reliability"
msgstr "ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ការ​អាច​ទុកចិត្ត​បាន​ប្រសើរ"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In all of our previous examples we've relied on &kstart; and <application>"
"ksystraycmd</application> to figure out which window we want to affect, and "
"unless we say otherwise, they assume that the first window to appear is the one "
"we want. This policy is usually OK because we are starting the application at "
"the same time, but it can fail badly when lots of windows are appearing (such "
"as when you log on). To make our commands more robust we can use the <option>"
"--window</option> parameter. This specifies the title of the target window. The "
"following example uses the <option>--window</option> "
"parameter to ensure that a particular konsole window is affected:"
msgstr "នៅ​ក្នុង​ឧទាហរណ៍​មុន​របស់​ពួក​យើង យើង​បាន​ផ្អែក​លើ Kstart និង "
"<application>ksystraycmd</application> "
"ដើម្បី​រក​បង្អួច​មួយ​ណា​ដែល​យើង​ចង់​ឲ្យ​ប៉ះពាល់ និង​ទាល់​តែ​យើង​និយាយ "
"បើ​មិន​ដូច្នោះ​ទេ ពួក​វា​សន្មត​ថា "
"បង្អួច​ដំបូង​លេចឡើង​គឺ​ជា​បង្អួច​ដែល​យើង​ចង់​បាន ។ "
"គោលការណ៍​នេះ​គឺ​ជានិច្ចជាកាល យល់ព្រម "
"ប៉ុន្តែ​ពួក​យើង​កំពុង​ចាប់ផ្ដើម​កម្មវិធី​នៅ​ពេល​តែ​មួយ "
"ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​អាច​បរាជ័យ​យ៉ាង​មិន​ល្អ ពេល​បង្អួច​ច្រើន​កំពុង​លេចឡើង "
"(ដូចជា​ពេល​យើង​ចូល) ។ ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​របស់​យើង​កាន់​តែ​មាំមួន "
"យើង​អាច​ប្រើ​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ <option>--window</option> ។ "
"នេះ​បញ្ជាក់​ចំណង​ជើង​បង្អួច​គោលដៅ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍​ខាងក្រោម​ប្រើ​ប៉ារ៉ាម៉ែត្រ "
"<option>--window</option> "
"ដើម្បី​ធានា​ថា​បង្អួច​កុងសូល​ពិសេស​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប៉ះពាល់ ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: windows-how-to.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command> <option>"
"--iconify</option> <option>--window</option> 'kstart_me' konsole\n"
"--caption 'kstart_me' -e tail -f\n"
"~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kstart</command> "
"<option>--iconify</option> <option>--window</option> 'kstart_me' konsole\n"
"--caption 'kstart_me' -e tail -f\n"
"~/.xsession-errors</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here we've used the tried and tested technique of specifying a title for both "
"&kstart; and the target application. This is generally the best way to use "
"&kstart; and <application>ksystraycmd</application>. The <option>"
"--window</option> argument is supported by both &kstart; and <option>"
"ksystraycmd</option> and can be regular expression (&eg; <quote>"
"window[0-9]</quote>) as well as a particular title. (Regular expressions are a "
"powerful pattern matching tool you'll find used throughout &kde;.)"
msgstr "ទីនេះ យើង​បាន​ប្រើ​បច្ចេកទេស​ដែល​បាន​សាកល្បង "
"និង​ប្រើ​នៃ​ការ​បញ្ញចាក់​ចំណង​ជើង​សម្រាប់​ទាំង Kstart និង​កម្មវិធី​គោលដៅ ។ "
"នេះ​ជា​ទូទៅ​គឺ​ជា​វិធី​ប្រសើរ​បំផុត​ដើម្បី​ប្រើ Kstart និង "
"<application>Ksystraycmd</application> ។ អាគុយម៉ង់ <option>--window</option>"
" ត្រូវ​បាន​គាំទ្រ​ដោយ​ទាំង Kstart និង <option>ksystraycmd</option> "
"និង​អាច​ជា​កន្សោម​ធម្មតា (ឧ. <quote>window[0-9]</quote>) "
"រួម​ទាំង​ចំណង​ជើង​ពិសេស ។ "
"(កន្សោម​ធម្មតា​គឺ​ជា​ឧបករណ៍​ផ្គូផ្គង​លំនាំ​មាន​អនុភាព "
"អ្នក​នឹង​ឃើញ​មាន​ប្រយោជន៍​ទូទាំង KDE ។)"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:474
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Multiple Desktops"
msgstr "ប្រើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​ច្រើន"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid "Virtual Desktops"
msgstr "ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត"

#. Tag: primary
#: windows-how-to.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiple Desktops"
msgstr "ផ្ទៃតុ​ច្រើន"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes, one screen's worth is just not enough space. If you use many "
"applications at the same time, and find yourself drowning in different windows, "
"virtual desktops offer the solution. By default, &kde; has four virtual "
"desktops, each one of which is like a separate screen: you can open windows, "
"move windows around, and set backgrounds and icons on each of the desktops. If "
"you are familiar with the concept of virtual terminals, you will have no "
"trouble with &kde;'s virtual desktops."
msgstr "ពេល​ខ្លះ តម្លៃ​របស់​អេក្រង់​មួយ​គឺ​មិន​គ្រប់គ្រាន់ ។ "
"បើ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​កម្មវិធី​ច្រើន​នៅ​ពេល​តែ​មួយ "
"និង​ឃើញ​ថា​ខ្លួន​អ្នក​កំពុង​លង់​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​ផ្សេង​គ្នា "
"ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​ផ្ដល់​ដំណោះ​ស្រាយ ។ ដោយ​លំនាំ​ដើម KDE មាន​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​បួន "
"នីមួយៗ​ដូចជា​អេក្រង់​ដែល​បែក​ចេញ​ពី​គ្នា ៖ អ្នក​អាច​បើក​បង្អួច "
"ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច​ជុំវិញ និង​កំណត់​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ "
"និង​រូប​តំណាង​នៅ​លើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​នីមួយៗ ។ បើ​អ្នក​ស៊ាំ​ជាមួយ​គំនិត​ស្ថានីយ​និម្មិត"
" អ្នក​នឹង​មិន​មាន​បញ្ហា​ជាមួយ​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​របស់ KDE ទេ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switching Virtual Desktops"
msgstr "ប្ដូរ​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move to a different virtual desktop, you can use <keycombo action=\"simul\">"
"&Ctrl;&Tab; </keycombo> in the same way as you would use <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Alt;&Tab; </keycombo> to switch between windows (see <xref "
"linkend=\"switching-between-windows\"/>): Hold down &Ctrl; and then press "
"&Tab;. A small popup window appears, showing the virtual desktops, with one "
"highlighted. If you release &Ctrl;, &kde; will switch to the highlighted "
"virtual desktop. To select a different desktop, press &Tab; repeatedly, while "
"holding down &Ctrl;. The selection moves through the available desktops. When "
"the desktop you want to switch to is highlighted, release &Ctrl;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: windows-how-to.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "Windows and Virtual Desktops"
msgstr "បង្អួច និង​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត"

#. Tag: para
#: windows-how-to.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can move windows around your virtual desktops with the <guisubmenu>"
"To Desktop</guisubmenu> item in the window menu: just select the desktop to "
"which you want to move the window. You can make the window appear on all "
"desktops with the <guimenuitem>All Desktops</guimenuitem><indexterm><primary>"
"Sticky Windows</primary></indexterm> item."
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច​ជុំវិញ​ផ្ទៃតុ​និម្មិត​ជាមួយ​ធាតុ "
"<guisubmenu>ទៅ​ផ្ទៃតុ</guisubmenu> ក្នុង​ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច ៖ "
"គ្រាន់​តែ​ជ្រើស​ផ្ទៃតុ​ទៅ​អ្វី​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ផ្លាស់ទី​បង្អួច ។ "
"អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​បង្អួច​លេចឡើង​លើ​ផ្ទៃតុ​ទាំងអស់​ជាមួយ​ធាតុ <guimenuitem>ផ្"
"ទៃតុ​ទាំងអស់</guimenuitem><indexterm><primary>បង្អួច​ស្អិត</primary></indext"
"erm> ។"
